# Pin the public registry for this project.
#
# Without this, pnpm inherits whatever registry the machine is configured for.
# On mine that is a corporate Artifactory proxy, and every one of the 442
# entries in pnpm-lock.yaml resolved to an internal host. That lockfile is
# useless to anyone outside that network, it failed CI on the first push, and it
# put an internal hostname in a public repository, which SPEC.md forbids.
#
# No credentials belong in this file. It is committed.
registry=https://registry.npmjs.org/
